ht mb-8 drop-shadow-sm\">Programmes combine classical text study with academic research training, taught by departmental faculty and visiting specialists.</p><a href=\"#program-categories\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-emerald-700 hover:bg-emerald-600 text-white text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium px-6 py-3.5 rounded-full transition shadow-lg\"><span>Explore programmes</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></section></div><section id=\"program-categories\" class=\"py-16 md:py-24 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6\"><div class=\"mb-10\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><span class=\"w-6 h-0.5 bg-amber-600\"></span><span class=\"text-amber-700 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase\">OFFERINGS</span></div><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif text-slate-800 mb-3\">Programme Categories</h2><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm max-w-2xl leading-relaxed\">Programme families are managed as dynamic categories under Admission, so new intakes and courses appear here automatically.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between hover:shadow-md transition-shadow group p-4\"><div><div class=\"relative w-full aspect-video bg-slate-100 rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-4\"><img alt=\"Academic Programs\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"hidden md:block object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprogra